# Next.js App Router

This project uses **Next.js 16** App Router — APIs may differ from older Next.js versions. Read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` when unsure.

## Conventions

1. **Default to Server Components** — add `"use client"` only for hooks and events
2. **Workshop copy** lives in `src/lib/workshop-data.ts`, not hardcoded in pages
3. **Styling** — Tailwind v4 + Apple tokens in `globals.css`; reuse `src/components/ui/`
4. **No new UI libraries** (MUI, Chakra, etc.)
5. **No Supabase in this repo** — platform handles data; workshop-app is static demo content

## Layout primitives

Use `PageShell`, `PageHero`, `SectionTitle`, `AgendaList` for new pages — match existing Apple-styled patterns.
